    "license": "Synthetic public use file published by CMS for software development and research training. No beneficiary in the DE-SynPUF is a real Medicare patient. These figures are not a current Medicare fee schedule, not a bill, and not a payment rate. CMS coarsened, imputed, and suppressed variables, including line allowed charges, so the file must not be used to infer actual Medicare payments.",
